{"text":"I loved the Baby-Sitters Club, it was like my Bible. I loved it so much, yes, okay, okay, y'all know what I'm talking about? I loved it so much, I created a song about all the characters for a book report. I was the only one who wrote it, who did a song. And I stood there, and I was singing in front of all my classmates, and I felt so comfortable up there, and I was like, this is what I wanted to do. So I was always excited about class plays that would come up, but I never got any of the parts I desired. Kindergarten, gingerbread man, I wanted to be the gingerbread man. I got the role of sheep number two. Bah, that was my line. Joseph and his amazing Technicolor Dreamcoat, I wanted to be Joseph. I didn't care if it was for a guy or a girl, I wanted to be Joseph. I was a guy, I played one of the brothers, and this was my line. Now what do we do?","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.4},{"text":"loved","start":0.4,"end":0.76},{"text":"the","start":0.76,"end":1.0},{"text":"Baby-Sitters","start":1.0,"end":1.34},{"text":"Club","start":1.34,"end":1.56,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":1.64,"end":1.72},{"text":"was","start":1.72,"end":1.82},{"text":"like","start":1.82,"end":1.96},{"text":"my","start":1.96,"end":2.18},{"text":"Bible","start":2.18,"end":2.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":2.88,"end":2.94},{"text":"loved","start":2.94,"end":3.1},{"text":"it","start":3.1,"end":3.24},{"text":"so","start":3.24,"end":3.52},{"text":"much","start":3.52,"end":3.86,"punct":","},{"text":"yes","start":3.96,"end":4.16,"punct":","},{"text":"okay","start":4.48,"end":4.8,"punct":","},{"text":"okay","start":4.98,"end":5.32,"punct":","},{"text":"y'all","start":5.32,"end":5.58},{"text":"know","start":5.58,"end":5.76},{"text":"what","start":5.76,"end":5.86},{"text":"I'm","start":5.86,"end":6.0},{"text":"talking","start":6.0,"end":6.2},{"text":"about","start":6.2,"end":6.54,"punct":"?"},{"text":"I","start":6.94,"end":7.18},{"text":"loved","start":7.18,"end":7.32},{"text":"it","st